#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_sepa_direct_debit/models/account_batch_payment.py:0
msgid ""
"You cannot generate a SEPA Direct Debit file with a required collection date "
"inferior to the sending day + the minimum pre-notification period of %"
"(prenot_days)s days.\n"
"The minimum required date should be %(minimum_date)s."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ikke generere en SEPA Direct Debit-fil med en påkrævet "
"opkrævningsdato, der ligger før afsendelsesdagen plus den minimale "
"varselsperiode på %(prenot_days)s dage.\n"
"Den tidligste tilladte opkrævningsdato er %(minimum_date)s."

#. module: account_sepa_direct_debit
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_sepa_direct_debit/models/account_batch_payment.py:0
msgid ""
"Your company must have a creditor identifier in order to issue SEPA Direct "
"Debit payments requests. It can be defined in accounting module's settings."
msgstr ""
"Din virksomhed skal have et kreditor-ID for at kunne udstede SEPA Direct "
"Debit-betalingsanmodninger. Dette kan angives i regnskabsmodulets "
"indstillinger."

